# Evidence captures are redacted by hand and reviewed before saving.
# Raw HAR, raw SSE frames, cookies, tokens and full URLs are never stored here.
# Uncomment / adjust the broad patterns below only if you understand the risk.

# raw capture formats
*.har
*.saz
*.pcap
*.pcapng
*.sse
*.ndjson

# chrome profile copies
chrome-profile/
cdp-*/

# still images captured from the account UI
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
